      <title>Zimbabwe boat accident death toll hits 68 as 22 more bodies recovered</title>
      <link>https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/aug/15/more-bodies-recovered-after-zimbabwe-boat-accident</link>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Eighteen children among the people killed after ferry capsized on Lake Kariba&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Twenty-two more bodies have been recovered after a boat accident in Zimbabwe, taking the death toll to 68, police said on Saturday.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The ferry &lt;a href="https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/aug/12/zimbabwe-lake-kariba-ferry-capsize"&gt;capsized on Tuesday on Lake Kariba&lt;/a&gt;, on the border with Zambia. An investigation has suggested it was overloaded when it turned over during heavy winds.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/aug/15/more-bodies-recovered-after-zimbabwe-boat-accident"&gt;Continue reading...&lt;/a&gt;</description>
